</strong>, each with <strong>two upgrades</strong> and unique animations and art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>75+ enemies</strong>, each with unique abilities to challenge your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcb0145+ artifacts</strong> to shape and refine your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Prove your mastery </strong>by boosting the difficulty with the Descent system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Take on Daily Challenges</strong> with ever-changing twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff9 <strong>Battle through 3 acts</strong> to confront the <strong>Voidbringers</strong>, and uncover the truth!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
